  <conversation ID="TQAQ_Da_Naersean_Dialogue">
    <start ID="Start">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Grumbles*}}

        What do we desire? Make it quick!
	    </text>
      <choice GotoID="WhoAreYou">Who are you?</choice>
      <choice GotoID="Inventory">What wares do you sell?</choice>
      <choice GotoID="Portal">What's with the portal in your hut?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">Live and drink, wise ones.</choice>
    </start>
    <node ID="Questions">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Grumbles*}}

        What other questions do we have? Make them quick!
	    </text>
      <choice GotoID="WhoAreYou">Who are you?</choice>
      <choice GotoID="Inventory">What wares do you sell?</choice>
      <choice GotoID="Portal">What's with the portal in your hut?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">No more questions. Live and drink, wise ones.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="WhoAreYou">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Sighs*}}

        We go by Da Naersean. Anything else to bother us with?
	    </text>
      <choice GotoID="Questions">Yes, there are other things to ask.</choice>
      <choice Target="End">No, that's all. Live and drink, wise ones.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="Inventory">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Sighs*}}

        We barter in mage supplies. Anything else to bother us with?
	    </text>
      <choice GotoID="Questions">Yes, there are other things to ask.</choice>
      <choice Target="End">No, that's all. Live and drink, wise ones.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="Portal">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Sighs*}}

        The portal is to the foreign planar Raseke, through there one will find Riigip. Anything else to bother us with?
	    </text>
      <choice GotoID="Questions">Yes, there are other things to ask.</choice>
      <choice Target="End">No, that's all. Live and drink, wise ones.</choice>
    </node>
  </conversation>

