  <!--Quest-->

  <conversation ID="TQAQ_Spigseship_Dialogue">
    <start ID="Start">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Grumpfs*}}

        Greetings traveler, to my humble abode!
	  </text>
      <choice GotoID="WhoAreYou">Who are you?</choice>
      <choice GotoID="TradingHut">Where can I trade?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">Live and drink.</choice>
    </start>
    <node ID="WhoAreYou">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Chatters*}}

        Oh! Me? My denmates call me Spigseship, what's yours?
	  </text>
      <choice GotoID="Name">I'm =name=.</choice>
      <choice GotoID="Nobody">I'm Nobody.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="Name">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Rattles*}}

        Well, =name=, it's a pleasure meeting you! Anything I can do to welcome you into our den?
	  </text>
      <choice GotoID="TradingHut">Where can I trade?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">Live and drink.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="Nobody">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Rattles*}}

        Well then, either way, it's a pleasure meeting you! Anything I can do to welcome you into our den?
	  </text>
      <choice GotoID="TradingHut">Where can I trade?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">Live and drink.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="TradingHut">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Yops*}}

        Well, the main barter hut is to the west of here. Our local mage to the south east may also be willing to trade, but they tend to be a bit grumpy!
	  </text>
      <choice GotoID="Mage">Who's the mage?</choice>
      <choice Target="End">Thanks for the info, Live and drink.</choice>
    </node>
    <node ID="Mage">
      <text>
        {{emote|*Yaps*}}

        Da Naersean is what they go by! They're one of many within one mind. Fortunately, they don't forget each other as easily as I forget things! They are fairly disagreeable, but can supply you with mana if needed. Just be careful! 
	  </text>
      <choice Target="End">Thanks for the info, Live and drink.</choice>
    </node>
  </conversation>

